  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Elements</strong></td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Colour imparted to the flame</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">I</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Brick Red</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ca</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">II</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Violet</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">C</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Sr</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">III</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Apple Green</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">D</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ba</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">IV</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">Crimson Red</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>"
